{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If you see an object, approach and grab it. Check properties and move to random location. Repeat. list of available nodes: <Action ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToRandomLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />\"",
    "BT": {
